      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.74,
      "end_seconds": 9.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.96,
      "end_seconds": 15.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a tight band around my head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.0,
      "end_seconds": 19.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.06,
      "end_seconds": 23.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I take Thyronorm, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.8,
      "end_seconds": 27.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.72,
      "end_seconds": 41.75,
      "duration_seconds": 13.03,
      "text": "50 micrograms, I think that's what's on the box. Paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.76,
      "end_seconds": 46.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "roughly how long on that that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.45,
      "end_seconds": 49.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "About a year now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.36,
      "end_seconds": 53.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.09,
      "end_seconds": 61.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "probably ten days. Yeah. I just wanna get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.26,
      "end_seconds": 64.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.34,
      "end_seconds": 69.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.51,
      "end_seconds": 72.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "what brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.83,
      "end_seconds": 77.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I notice it more with long screen days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.39,
      "end_seconds": 82.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.55,
      "end_seconds": 91.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. Oh, and a stiff neck. That's been about the same, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.59,
      "end_seconds": 97.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.78,
      "end_seconds": 105.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "it comes and goes i had tired eyes before that's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.54,
      "end_seconds": 112.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "right, a a few quick ones: weakness, sensitivity to light or sickness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.47,
      "end_seconds": 116.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.25,
      "end_seconds": 118.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Any blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.37,
      "end_seconds": 121.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "no blurred vision thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.09,
      "end_seconds": 128.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.89,
      "end_seconds": 133.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.81,
      "end_seconds": 136.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.98,
      "end_seconds": 139.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.94,
      "end_seconds": 144.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.02,
      "end_seconds": 150.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "nothing, you know, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.75,
      "end_seconds": 155.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.1,
      "end_seconds": 159.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.8,
      "end_seconds": 172.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "right right yes an underactive thyroid is known to us good to have that clear any allergies to tablets food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.2,
      "end_seconds": 177.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "no, I've never reacted to to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.27,
      "end_seconds": 184.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.39,
      "end_seconds": 198.29,
      "duration_seconds": 12.9,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I live with my elderly mother. I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.58,
      "end_seconds": 219.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.32,
      "end_seconds": 230.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "That's it just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.74,
      "end_seconds": 254.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 14, blood pressure 119 over 72, temperature 36.9. And heart rate 65."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.1,
      "end_seconds": 260.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Okay now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.67,
      "end_seconds": 264.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.96,
      "end_seconds": 278.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.13,
      "end_seconds": 283.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.24,
      "end_seconds": 310.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.18,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is tension-type headache. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a a final answer. Another possibility is eye strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.15,
      "end_seconds": 313.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.24,
      "end_seconds": 348.17,
      "duration_seconds": 33.93,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now tension-type headache is my leading thought, not anything worse we should do an eye test for eye strain i'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference see me again in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.07,
      "end_seconds": 356.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "can you tell me the plan back in your own words so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.59,
      "end_seconds": 362.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "So So I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.22,
      "end_seconds": 367.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.88,
      "end_seconds": 373.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Okay, uh, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.11,
      "end_seconds": 376.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
